I18N.en = {
  nav_features: `Features`, nav_how: `How it works`, nav_privacy: `Privacy`,
  footer_tagline: `Smart, private security — from your phone.`,
  footer_privacy: `Privacy Policy`, footer_terms: `Terms & Conditions`, footer_support: `Support`,
  footer_rights: `All rights reserved.`, footer_madewith: `Built local-first, for your privacy.`,
  back_home: `← Back to home`,

  meta_title: `SecHome — Smart home security from your phone`,
  meta_desc: `Turn your phone into a smart, private security camera. On-device AI, IP camera support and free remote viewing — no video is ever uploaded to the cloud.`,
  hero_badge: `Privacy-first security`,
  hero_title: `Your home, watched over. Privately.`,
  hero_sub: `SecHome turns your phone into a smart security camera with on-device AI. Connect IP cameras, get alerts, and watch from anywhere — with no video ever uploaded to the cloud.`,
  store_soon: `Coming soon`,
  hero_note: `Local-first · On-device AI · Works with your existing IP cameras`,
  trust_1: `100% local`, trust_2: `On-device AI`, trust_3: `No video in the cloud`,

  feat_kicker: `Features`, feat_title: `Everything a security app should be`,
  feat_sub: `Powerful when you need it, private by default.`,
  f1_t: `On-device AI detection`, f1_d: `Detects people, vehicles and animals in real time — the AI runs on your phone, not on a server.`,
  f2_t: `Turn your phone into a camera`, f2_d: `Reuse an old phone as a security camera in seconds, with motion zones and smart recording.`,
  f3_t: `Works with your IP cameras`, f3_d: `Connect RTSP/ONVIF cameras and recorders — Dahua, Hikvision, Reolink, Amcrest and more.`,
  f4_t: `Watch from anywhere`, f4_d: `Leave a phone at home as a bridge and view your cameras from outside — free, with no port forwarding.`,
  f5_t: `Private by design`, f5_d: `Recordings, thumbnails and events stay on your device. Camera passwords are encrypted and never stored in the cloud.`,
  f6_t: `Smart notifications`, f6_d: `Get an instant alert — with a photo of what was detected — the moment something happens.`,
  f7_t: `Two-way audio & siren`, f7_d: `Talk through a linked camera and trigger a siren to scare off intruders.`,
  f8_t: `In your language`, f8_d: `Available in 32 languages, adapting automatically to your device.`,

  how_kicker: `How it works`, how_title: `Up and running in minutes`,
  how_sub: `No technical setup. No hub. No monthly fees.`,
  s1_t: `Install & sign up`, s1_d: `Create a free account and grant camera and notification access.`,
  s2_t: `Add your cameras`, s2_d: `Use this phone as a camera, connect an IP camera, or link another phone.`,
  s3_t: `Watch & get alerts`, s3_d: `Get notified when something is detected and watch live — at home or away.`,

  pt_title: `Your privacy is the point`,
  pt_body: `SecHome was built local-first. The AI runs on your phone, and your video never leaves your devices. The internet is used only for your account and, when needed, to connect your own devices securely.`,
  pt_cta: `Read our Privacy Policy`,

  pp_meta_title: `Privacy Policy — SecHome`,
  pp_meta_desc: `How SecHome protects your privacy: local-first, on-device AI, and no video uploaded to the cloud.`,
  pp_title: `Privacy Policy`, pp_updated: `Last updated: August 2026`,
  pp_lead: `<p class="lead">SecHome is built to be private by default. This policy explains, in plain language, what data we handle and — just as importantly — what we don't.</p>`,
  pp_s1_h: `1. Who we are`,
  pp_s1_b: `<p>SecHome ("we", "us") is the provider of the SecHome mobile app for Android and iOS. For any privacy question you can reach us at <a href="mailto:neowavecode@gmail.com">neowavecode@gmail.com</a>.</p>`,
  pp_s2_h: `2. Our core principle: local-first`,
  pp_s2_b: `<div class="callout"><p><strong>Your video never leaves your devices.</strong> Live streams, recordings, snapshots and detection events are stored only on your phone. Nothing is uploaded to our servers or the cloud.</p></div>`,
  pp_s3_h: `3. Data we process`,
  pp_s3_b: `<ul><li><strong>Account:</strong> your email address, used to create and sign in to your account.</li><li><strong>Recordings & events:</strong> stored locally on your device only.</li><li><strong>Camera credentials:</strong> the usernames and passwords of your IP cameras are stored encrypted on your device and are never sent to us.</li><li><strong>Basic device info:</strong> needed only to deliver notifications to your device.</li></ul>`,
  pp_s4_h: `4. On-device AI`,
  pp_s4_b: `<p>The detection of people, vehicles and animals runs entirely on your phone. No images or video are sent to any server for analysis, and we do not perform facial recognition.</p>`,
  pp_s5_h: `5. Remote viewing & the relay`,
  pp_s5_b: `<p>To watch your cameras from outside your home, another of your own phones can act as a secure bridge. The connection is peer-to-peer and encrypted. Your camera passwords travel encrypted end-to-end and can only be opened by your own bridge device — they are never stored or visible in the cloud. When a direct connection isn't possible, the encrypted video may be relayed through a connectivity server (TURN) to reach your device; it is not recorded or stored there.</p>`,
  pp_s6_h: `6. Third-party services`,
  pp_s6_b: `<ul><li><strong>Supabase</strong> — account authentication and the secure signaling that lets your own devices find each other.</li><li><strong>Google Firebase</strong> — used, when available, to deliver push notifications and to collect anonymous, aggregated usage and crash data that helps us improve the app.</li><li><strong>TURN/STUN connectivity servers</strong> — used only to establish the encrypted connection between your devices for remote viewing.</li><li><strong>Google Drive</strong> — used only if you personally choose to save a recording to your own Drive.</li></ul>`,
  pp_s7_h: `7. Data retention`,
  pp_s7_b: `<p>Recordings and events are kept on your device and are automatically deleted according to the retention period you choose in the app. You can delete any recording — or your entire history — at any time. Your account data is kept until you delete your account.</p>`,
  pp_s8_h: `8. Your rights`,
  pp_s8_b: `<p>You can access, correct or delete your data at any time. The app lets you delete individual recordings, your full history, and your account. If you are in the EU/EEA, you also have the rights granted by the GDPR, including access, rectification, erasure and portability. To exercise them, contact us at <a href="mailto:neowavecode@gmail.com">neowavecode@gmail.com</a>.</p>`,
  pp_s9_h: `9. Children`,
  pp_s9_b: `<p>SecHome is not directed to children under 16, and we do not knowingly collect their data.</p>`,
  pp_s10_h: `10. Changes to this policy`,
  pp_s10_b: `<p>We may update this policy from time to time. Material changes will be reflected here with a new date at the top.</p>`,
  pp_s11_h: `11. Contact`,
  pp_s11_b: `<p>Questions about your privacy? Email us at <a href="mailto:neowavecode@gmail.com">neowavecode@gmail.com</a>.</p>`,

  tc_meta_title: `Terms & Conditions — SecHome`,
  tc_meta_desc: `The terms for using the SecHome app.`,
  tc_title: `Terms & Conditions`, tc_updated: `Last updated: August 2026`,
  tc_lead: `<p class="lead">Please read these terms carefully. By downloading or using SecHome, you agree to them.</p>`,
  tc_s1_h: `1. Acceptance`,
  tc_s1_b: `<p>By installing or using the SecHome app (the "App"), you agree to be bound by these Terms & Conditions. If you do not agree, please do not use the App.</p>`,
  tc_s2_h: `2. Licence`,
  tc_s2_b: `<p>We grant you a personal, non-exclusive, non-transferable licence to use the App on devices you own or control, for your own private, non-commercial security purposes.</p>`,
  tc_s3_h: `3. Lawful use — your responsibility`,
  tc_s3_b: `<div class="callout"><p>You may only monitor spaces that you own or are legally authorised to monitor. You are solely responsible for complying with all applicable laws on video surveillance, privacy and audio recording in your country — some places restrict or prohibit recording audio or filming certain areas. Do not use the App to harass, stalk or spy on anyone.</p></div>`,
  tc_s4_h: `4. Your account`,
  tc_s4_b: `<p>You are responsible for keeping your account credentials secure and for all activity under your account. Please notify us of any unauthorised use.</p>`,
  tc_s5_h: `5. Third-party cameras & services`,
  tc_s5_b: `<p>The App can connect to third-party IP cameras and services (for example Dahua, Hikvision or Google Drive). We are not responsible for those products or services, and your use of them is subject to their own terms. Brand names belong to their respective owners.</p>`,
  tc_s6_h: `6. Availability & "as is"`,
  tc_s6_b: `<p>The App is provided "as is" and "as available", without warranties of any kind. We do not guarantee uninterrupted or error-free operation, and the App is not a substitute for a professional monitored security or emergency service. Please do not rely on it as your sole means of protection.</p>`,
  tc_s7_h: `7. Limitation of liability`,
  tc_s7_b: `<p>To the maximum extent permitted by law, we are not liable for any indirect, incidental or consequential damages, or for any loss arising from missed detections, failed recordings, connectivity issues or your use of the App. Nothing in these terms limits liability that cannot be limited by law.</p>`,
  tc_s8_h: `8. Intellectual property`,
  tc_s8_b: `<p>The App, its design and its content are owned by us and protected by intellectual-property laws. You may not copy, modify, reverse-engineer or redistribute the App except as permitted by law.</p>`,
  tc_s9_h: `9. Termination`,
  tc_s9_b: `<p>You may stop using the App and delete your account at any time. We may suspend or terminate access if these terms are breached.</p>`,
  tc_s10_h: `10. Changes`,
  tc_s10_b: `<p>We may update these terms. Continued use of the App after changes means you accept the updated terms.</p>`,
  tc_s11_h: `11. Governing law`,
  tc_s11_b: `<p>These terms are governed by the laws of Spain and the European Union, without prejudice to the mandatory consumer-protection rights of your country of residence.</p>`,
  tc_s12_h: `12. Contact`,
  tc_s12_b: `<p>Questions about these terms? Email us at <a href="mailto:neowavecode@gmail.com">neowavecode@gmail.com</a>.</p>`,

  sup_meta_title: `Support — SecHome`,
  sup_meta_desc: `Get help with SecHome. Contact us and read answers to common questions.`,
  sup_title: `Support`,
  sup_lead: `<p class="lead">Need a hand? We're happy to help.</p>`,
  sup_contact_h: `Contact us`,
  sup_contact_b: `Email us and we'll get back to you as soon as we can — usually within a couple of business days.`,
  sup_send: `Send a message`,
  sup_faq_h: `Frequently asked questions`,
  faq1_q: `Which cameras does SecHome support?`,
  faq1_a: `Any RTSP/ONVIF IP camera or recorder (NVR/DVR), including Dahua, Hikvision, Reolink and Amcrest. You can also use any Android or iOS phone as a camera. Cloud-only cameras (such as Nest or Ring) are not supported because they hide their video stream.`,
  faq2_q: `Can I watch my cameras when I'm away from home?`,
  faq2_a: `Yes. Leave a phone at home with SecHome and turn on "Bridge mode". You'll then be able to watch your cameras from anywhere — for free and without opening ports on your router.`,
  faq3_q: `Is my video uploaded to the cloud?`,
  faq3_a: `No. All video stays on your devices. The AI runs on your phone and nothing is uploaded to our servers. See our Privacy Policy for details.`,
  faq4_q: `Does the AI detection work offline?`,
  faq4_a: `Yes. Detection of people, vehicles and animals runs entirely on your device, so it works even without an internet connection.`,
  faq5_q: `How do I change the app language?`,
  faq5_a: `SecHome follows your phone's language automatically. You can also choose it manually in Settings → Language, from 32 available languages.`,
  faq6_q: `How do I delete my recordings or my account?`,
  faq6_a: `You can delete individual recordings or your whole history from the app, and delete your account from Settings. Deletion is permanent.`,
  sup_response_h: `Response time`,
  sup_response_b: `We're a small team, so please allow a couple of business days for a reply. Including your device model and app version helps us help you faster.`,
};

